      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following are eighth-order ordinary differential equations?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** ${x}^{10}{y}^{\u2032}+y\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}={y}^{\u2032}(\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{8}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{8}})^{4}$\n- **II.** ${x}^{5}{y}^{\u2032}+y\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}={y}^{\u2032}(\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{4}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{4}})^{2}$\n- **III.** ${y}^{\u2032}(\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{4}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{4}})^{2}={x}^{6}{y}^{\u2032}+y\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}$",
